This MIT license covers the SOFTWARE in this repository (the pipeline code,
scripts, and dashboard). The donation records themselves are drawn from public
government filings (FEC and state campaign-finance portals) and are matters of
public record. The archive's attribution and verification layer — which record
ties to which owner, and the signal trail behind it — is original work; a
data-use / attribution statement for that layer is intentionally left to a
future decision (see docs/IMPROVEMENT_PLAN_2026-07.md §7).
